心蛋，有需要的也可以加點。\n\n薯條也是一般的薯條，不過炸的功夫還滿可以的，顏色很加分。\n\n外場雖然只有一位，但服務態度很棒喔...\n\n外帶的客人也非常多，內用的桌位是10桌，用餐時間人潮多一些，但翻桌的速度也滿快的，不用等太久...\n\n綜合評價是：可以做為一般用餐吃飯的選項喔...",null,[0,44]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2273107233500819075/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlBjbDlsVVdSQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2273107233500819075/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlBjbDlsVVdSQkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2273107233500819075/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlBjbDlsVVdSQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2273107233500819075/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlBjbDlsVVdSQkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2273107233500819075/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlBjbDlsVVdSQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2273107233500819075/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlBjbDlsVVdSQkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,7107,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURPcl9lUWRBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xa7830075ce245c1b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDOr_eQdA%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURPcl9lUWRBEAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURPcl9lUWRBEi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRE9yX2VROUFFEhNDZ3dJZ29IUWxnWVEySS1obWdNGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRE9yX2VRREESE0Nnd0lnb0hRbGdZUTJJLWhtZ00iEgkAAAAAAAAAABEbXCTOdQCDpyoLMFhwLTExbkgzVU4\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjaxsHTwNKWAxU7m68BHUb6O8kQoykI-gEoCg"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjXz8fTwNKWAxXUgNYIHRgaNAYQ0pMFCKEBKAU"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjaxsHTwNKWAxU7m68BHUb6O8kQ0pMFCOYBKAU"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkdGJHMTVObEZPU2tSWGRtaFRhMUJ6Ymt4MGJFRRAB",["0x0:0xa7830075ce245c1b",null,1757612269968693,1757612269968693,[null,null,["https://w